<title>UK: Argent buys seven UK Littlewoods stores.</title>
<headline>Argent buys seven UK Littlewoods stores.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property investment and development group Argent Plc said on Monday it bought seven stores from British retailer Littlewoods for 32.2 million stg.</p>
<p>Argent said in a statement the stores, in Bristol, Cheltenham, Glasgow, Kirkcaldy, Lewisham, Weston-Super-Mare and Oldham, have been leased back to Littlewoods on new 25-year leases for an aggregate initial rent of 2.46 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
